[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "startSeconds": 0.0,
    "endSeconds": 6.61,
    "text": "In the time before memory, when the world was still learning what it was, the Creator made the trees.",
    "charStart": 0,
    "charEnd": 101
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "startSeconds": 6.61,
    "endSeconds": 11.86,
    "text": "Each tree was given a form, a purpose, and a place in the order of things.",
    "charStart": 103,
    "charEnd": 177
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "startSeconds": 11.86,
    "endSeconds": 18.06,
    "text": "The palm tree was given height and grace, and told to provide shade and fruit and fibre.",
    "charStart": 179,
    "charEnd": 267
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "startSeconds": 18.06,
    "endSeconds": 26.21,
    "text": "The silk-cotton tree was given size and power, and told to be a home for birds and a shelter for the creatures of the forest.",
    "charStart": 269,
    "charEnd": 394
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "startSeconds": 26.21,
    "endSeconds": 30.57,
    "text": "The mango was given sweetness, and told to be generous.",
    "charStart": 396,
    "charEnd": 451
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "startSeconds": 30.57,
    "endSeconds": 36.0,
    "text": "The acacia was given thorns, and told to be strong without being cruel.",
    "charStart": 453,
    "charEnd": 524
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "startSeconds": 36.0,
    "endSeconds": 38.98,
    "text": "And then the Creator made the baobab.",
    "charStart": 526,
    "charEnd": 563
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "startSeconds": 38.98,
    "endSeconds": 41.39,
    "text": "Oh, but the baobab.",
    "charStart": 565,
    "charEnd": 584
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "startSeconds": 41.39,
    "endSeconds": 43.89,
    "text": "The baobab was given everything.",
    "charStart": 586,
    "charEnd": 618
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "startSeconds": 43.89,
    "endSeconds": 45.56,
    "text": "A trunk like a palace.",
    "charStart": 619,
    "charEnd": 641
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "startSeconds": 45.56,
    "endSeconds": 47.52,
    "text": "Bark smooth as ceremony.",
    "charStart": 642,
    "charEnd": 666
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "startSeconds": 47.52,
    "endSeconds": 49.78,
    "text": "Leaves of bright, delicate green.",
    "charStart": 667,
    "charEnd": 700
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "startSeconds": 49.78,
    "endSeconds": 51.05,
    "text": "Fruit full of goodness.",
    "charStart": 701,
    "charEnd": 724
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "startSeconds": 51.05,
    "endSeconds": 52.67,
    "text": "Flowers white as cloud.",
    "charStart": 725,
    "charEnd": 748
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "startSeconds": 52.67,
    "endSeconds": 57.09,
    "text": "It was, without question, the most magnificent tree in all of creation.",
    "charStart": 749,
    "charEnd": 820
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "startSeconds": 57.09,
    "endSeconds": 59.73,
    "text": "And the baobab knew it.",
    "charStart": 822,
    "charEnd": 845
  }
]